<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:66.66%">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The Athletics Department, known to the campus as the “Home of the Vikings”, is part of the Student Affairs Division of the college. For detailed information on our programs, please visit our&nbsp;<strong><a href="https://www.occvikings.com/landing/index" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="">athletics website</a>.</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">To get involved in Ocean County College’s nationally-ranked Athletics program, please complete the online&nbsp;<a href="https://occvikings.com/student_athletes/recruiting_form" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="">Be Recruited form</a>&nbsp;or call 732-255-0345.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Follow us on social media: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/occvikingathletics/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="Facebook">Facebook</a>, <a href="https://www.instagram.com/ocean_cc_vikings/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="Instagram">Instagram</a>, <a href="https://x.com/OceanVikings" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="Twitter/X">Twitter/X</a></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>
</div>
</div>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading alignwide">Athletic Department Staff</h3>



